WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.780
John opens a door.

2
00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:05.390
He has no idea a tray
of cups is behind it.

3
00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:09.070
Crash: 15 cups, smashed.

4
00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:13.170
While his mum is out, Henry
sneaks jam from a high cupboard.

5
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:16.110
He knocks over 1 cup, and it breaks.

6
00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.450
Ask a young child which boy is naughtier,

7
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.830
and they point straight at John.

8
00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:22.900
Don't they know right from wrong yet?

9
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:25.430
Were they taught that accidents are worse?

10
00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.280
So why John?

11
00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:30.410
In this mission, you'll
find out what morality is:

12
00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:34.850
a system of ideas about right and
wrong that guides how people behave.

13
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:37.300
And you'll see how
moral thinking develops,

14
00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:41.030
from Piaget's paired stories
to Kohlberg's dilemmas.

15
00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.790
Your mission: explain why young
children call John the naughtier one.
